From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jurrebuunk <jurrebuunk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:35:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] OpenID Connect login

Sign in with an external OIDC provider (Keycloak): authorization code
flow with PKCE, state and nonce, for a confidential client. Configured
from OIDC_* environment variables; off when OIDC_ISSUER is unset.
The provider's picture claim (an https address) becomes the account's
avatar at each sign-in; the avatar endpoint redirects to it.
See service/oidclogin.
